{"translation-revision-date":"2026-10-31 19:27+0100","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"assets\/app\/components\/Panels\/FieldGroupSettings\/BlockJSONSettings.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"hu_HU","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"The path is not writable.":["Az el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fat nem \u00edrhat\u00f3."],"Are you sure you want to override the block settings from the block.json file?":["Biztosan fel\u00fcl akarod b\u00edr\u00e1lni a blokkbe\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat a block.json f\u00e1jlban megadott \u00e9rt\u00e9kekkel?"],"Failed to override block.json":["Nem siker\u00fclt fel\u00fclb\u00edr\u00e1lni a block.json-t"],"Block JSON settings":["Blokk-JSON-be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok"],"Block folder":["Blokkmappa"],"Enter absolute path to the folder containing the <code>block.json<\/code> and block asset files. <b>Do not include the block name (e.g. field group ID)<\/b>. The full path for the block files will be like <code>path\/to\/folder\/block-name\/block.json<\/code>.":["Add meg annak a mapp\u00e1nak az abszol\u00fat el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fatj\u00e1t, amely a <code>block.json<\/code>-t \u00e9s a blokk er\u0151forr\u00e1sf\u00e1jljait tartalmazza. <b>Ne t\u00fcntesd fel a blokk nev\u00e9t (pl. a mez\u0151csoport ID-j\u00e9t)<\/b>. A blokkf\u00e1jlok teljes el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fatja ilyen lesz: <code>path\/to\/folder\/block-name\/block.json<\/code>."],"Override from block.json":["Fel\u00fclb\u00edr\u00e1l\u00e1s a block.json alapj\u00e1n"],"We detected a newer version of block.json, do you want to override settings from this file?":["\u00dajabb block.json-verzi\u00f3t \u00e9szlelt\u00fcnk. Fel\u00fcl akarod b\u00edr\u00e1lni a be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sokat a f\u00e1jlban megadott \u00e9rt\u00e9kekkel?"],"Yes, override from block.json":["Igen, fel\u00fclb\u00edr\u00e1l\u00e1s a block.json alapj\u00e1n"],"Supported variables":["T\u00e1mogatott v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3k"],"Site path":["Webhely el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fatja"],"Site URL":["Webhely URL-je"],"Path to the current [child] theme directory":["Az aktu\u00e1lis [gyermek]sablonk\u00f6nyvt\u00e1r el\u00e9r\u00e9si \u00fatja"],"URL to the current [child] theme directory":["Az aktu\u00e1lis [gyermek]sablonk\u00f6nyvt\u00e1r URL-je"]}}}